    "w": "龙",
    "explain": "很长的动物，在天上飞。",
    "en": "dragon"
   },
   {
    "w": "眼睛",
    "explain": "看东西的，在脸上。",
    "en": "eyes"
   }
  ],
  "nodes": [
   {
    "id": "a",
    "say": "我叫马良。我有神笔：我画什么，什么就活了！",
    "translate": "I’m 马良. I have a magic brush: whatever I paint comes alive!",
    "next": "b",
    "onEnter": [
     {
      "do": "quest",
      "quest": "side-maliang",
      "step": "do"
     }
    ],
    "why": "Homage to the folk tale 《神笔马良》 (Ma Liang and the Magic Brush): a poor boy’s brush makes his paintings real, and he paints only for people who need it."
   },
   {
    "id": "b",
    "say": "你说，神笔画什么？",
    "translate": "Tell me — what shall I paint?",
    "expect": [
     {
      "intent": "draw",
      "match": [
       [
        "鸟",
        "鱼",
        "花",
        "猫",
        "马",
        "狗",
        "龙"
       ]
      ],
      "go": "c"
     }
    ],
    "hint": {
     "word": "鸟",
     "frame": "画一只___吧！",
     "full": "画一只鸟吧！"
    }
   },
   {
    "id": "c",
    "say": "好！……你看，它活了！",
    "translate": "Done! …Look, it’s alive!",
    "next": "d"
   },
   {
    "id": "d",
    "say": "画龙的时候，眼睛要后画。有了眼睛，龙就活了。",
    "translate": "When you paint a dragon, the eyes come last. Paint the eyes, and the dragon lives.",
    "onEnter": [
     {
      "do": "quest_done",
      "quest": "side-maliang"
     }
    ],
    "why": "That is 画龙点睛 — the finale of the story in the palace."
   }
  ]
 },
